"},{"id":1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"druzac","id":865068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTA2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/865068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac","html_url":"https://github.com/druzac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"druzac","id":865068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTA2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/865068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac","html_url":"https://github.com/druzac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/druzac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-10-27T17:15:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T20:04:54Z","closed_at":"2025-11-05T20:04:54Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-18859](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18859)\r\n### Description\n\nThe `ExternalMiniClusterOptions` comments say:\n```\n  // Specifies the replication factor for the cluster. If this is not set, default to the number\n  // of masters in the cluster.\n  int replication_factor = 0;\n```\n\nThis default is misleading. If `replication_factor` is unset, a bug causes replication factor to default to 3 on the yb processes spawned by the test harness, regardless of what `ExternalMiniClusterOptions::num_masters` is set to. This bug is causing some tests to fail when trying to enable object locking because the test does not set `replication_factor`, only spawns a single tserver, and does not create any tables. With object locking enabled the master leader tries to create a table for the `pg_advisory_locks` feature when handling the first pg connection. With only one tablet server and a replication factor of 3 this does not succeed, failing the test.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-18859]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-18859?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"druzac","id":865068,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTA2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/865068?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.git